    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berk Kalfa, the founder and game developer at Hittite Games, proudly presents <strong>Car Crash Chaos</strong>! \ud83d\ude98\ud83d\udca5 <br>In Car Crash Chaos, you'll find nearly 100 different vehicles: American classic cars, Soviet classic cars, European cars, Japanese JDM cars, sports cars, trucks, motorcycles, Asian tuk-tuks, and buses \u2013 offering a wide variety of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish, you can cause a traffic accident at your leisure in an Asian city \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f, or in an American town, you can speed along by weaving through traffic with your chosen vehicle. Likewise, on a highway with flowing traffic, you can perform daring lane changes to enjoy fun moments. Or you can challenge your imagination even further by crashing your car on a planet in outer space \ud83c\udf0c.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After outer space, if you prefer a calm, foggy forest \ud83c\udf32 or a rural area, you can drive there as well. Additionally, depending on the severity of the crash, the driver (crash test dummy) in your vehicle may be ejected, or your airbags might deploy following a frontal impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While playing, you can listen to Car Crash Chaos\u2019s soundtracks \ud83c\udfb6 to enjoy an even more entertaining driving experience. All cars, trucks, buses, motorcycles, and tuk-tuks in the game are unlocked from the start, allowing you to choose any vehicle for your crashes right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy crashing various vehicles and driving to high-tempo music, get <strong>Car Crash Chaos</strong> now! The only limit in Car Crash Chaos is your imagination! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Berk Kalfa, the founder and game developer at Hittite Games, proudly presents <strong>Car Crash Chaos</strong>! \ud83d\ude98\ud83d\udca5 <br>In Car Crash Chaos, you'll find nearly 100 different vehicles: American classic cars, Soviet classic cars, European cars, Japanese JDM cars, sports cars, trucks, motorcycles, Asian tuk-tuks, and buses \u2013 offering a wide variety of options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you wish, you can cause a traffic accident at your leisure in an Asian city \ud83c\udfd9\ufe0f, or in an American town, you can speed along by weaving through traffic with your chosen vehicle. Likewise, on a highway with flowing traffic, you can perform daring lane changes to enjoy fun moments. Or you can challenge your imagination even further by crashing your car on a planet in outer space \ud83c\udf0c.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After outer space, if you prefer a calm, foggy forest \ud83c\udf32 or a rural area, you can drive there as well. Additionally, depending on the severity of the crash, the driver (crash test dummy) in your vehicle may be ejected, or your airbags might deploy following a frontal impact.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While playing, you can listen to Car Crash Chaos\u2019s soundtracks \ud83c\udfb6 to enjoy an even more entertaining driving experience. All cars, trucks, buses, motorcycles, and tuk-tuks in the game are unlocked from the start, allowing you to choose any vehicle for your crashes right away.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you enjoy crashing various vehicles and driving to high-tempo music, get <strong>Car Crash Chaos</strong> now! The only limit in Car Crash Chaos is your imagination! \ud83d\ude80</p>",
    "short_description": "Ready for fun crashes? Car Crash Chaos offers nearly 100 vehicles, from classics and trucks to JDM cars and motorcycles. Enjoy playful collisions in cities, highways, and outer space with high-tempo music. The only limit is your imagination! \ud83d\ude97\ud83c\udfb6\ud83d\ude80",
